The '''Goblin Queen's Den''' is a location in the {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}, more specifically the {{Zone|Goblin Holdout}}, where the {{Item|Amber Crystal}} can be obtained.

{{ZoneText|Buried deep underground away from prying eyes.|The mythic Goblin Queen lays in wait.|She seeks replacements for her now missing King...}}

== Purpose ==
After giving {{Item|Goblin Egg|amount=1}} to {{NPCSprite|King Yolkar}} to obtain the {{PotionName|King's Scent}} [[Potions|effect]], the player can enter the '''Goblin Queen's Den''' to obtain the {{Item|Amber Crystal}}.

== Trivia ==
* Using a {{Item|Wishing Compass}} while {{PotionName|King's Scent}} is active points to the '''Goblin Queen's Den'''.
* Prior to 0.20.6, the {{Item|Amber Crystal}} could be claimed multiple times with one {{PotionName|King's Scent}}.

